  "sample": {
    "markdown": "# Executive summary\n\nExample Co proposes to redesign the ACME public website so that customers find products faster and the team can publish content without developer help.\n\n::: folio-info\n:::\n\n# Context\n\nACME's current site was built in 2019. Analytics show that 60% of visitors leave from the product listing pages.\n\n# Scope\n\n- Information architecture and navigation\n- Visual design system and page templates\n- Content migration of 120 product pages\n- Analytics and accessibility review (WCAG 2.2 AA)\n\n# Approach\n\nWe work in two-week iterations with a demo at the end of each one.\n\n# Plan\n\n::: {.folio-milestones show_payments=true}\n:::\n\n# Deliverables\n\n::: folio-deliverables\n:::\n\n# Budget\n\n::: folio-budget\n:::\n\n# Terms\n\nPrices exclude travel. Invoices are payable within 30 days.\n\n# Acceptance\n\n::: folio-signatures\n:::\n",
